ver", "PublicTransportVR"], "long_description": "Welcome to Bus Simulation VR - Bus Driving Game, the ultimate virtual reality bus driving experience!\n\nStep into the role of a professional bus driver and navigate busy city streets, modern highways, and realistic urban environments. Transport passengers safely to their destinations, manage bus stops, obey traffic laws, and master challenging driving routes.\n\nExperience immersive VR gameplay with detailed bus interiors, realistic vehicle physics, smooth controls, and dynamic city traffic. Whether you're cruising through downtown streets or handling tight turns and busy intersections, every journey feels authentic and engaging.\n\nFeatures\n\ud83d\ude8c Realistic bus driving simulation in VR\n\ud83c\udf06 Detailed city environments and roads\n\ud83d\udc65 Passenger pick-up and drop-off system\n\ud83d\udea6 Traffic lights, road signs, and AI traffic\n\ud83c\udfae Smooth and intuitive VR controls\n\ud83d\ude8f Multiple routes and bus stops\n\ud83c\udf24\ufe0f Dynamic environments and immersive visuals\n\ud83c\udfc6 Complete missions and improve your driving skills\n\ud83d\udd0a Realistic bus sounds and driving effects\n\nTake the wheel, follow your route, and become the city's most reliable bus driver in Bus Simulation VR - Bus Driving Game!", "short_description": "Bus Simulation VR - Bus Driving Game puts you in the driver\u2019s seat of a realistic city bus. Pick up passengers, follow traffic rules, complete routes, and explore detailed urban environments in an immersive virtual reality driving experience."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/artsidegames/home/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Art Side Game", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/artsidegames/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534",